  "body": "Add a Setup toolbar entry and expose the Setups page in a new document. Group operations under their setup in the browser. Give operations an explicit saved order, support drag and drop within a setup, and allow editing their displayed names without changing their stable identity or machining order. Preserve undo/redo and the posting, simulation, rest-machining, and project round-trip laws.",
